er, grade (freshman vs junior) and major (landscape vs non-landscape).\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very unlikely\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very likely\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"prs_fascination\",\n      \"title\": \"The setting has fascinating qualities.\",\n      \"description\": \"Short PRS, one item per dimension (Fascination); 1 = very unlikely, 7 = very likely, as in the paper. The paper does not list its four items; this wording is from Hartig's PRS as listed in Frontiers in Public Health 10:801453 (being away, fascination, compatibility) and PRS-11 (coherence). One record per landscape photograph: key = image id as in the paper's Figure 1 (a_mountain, b_field, c_waterscape, d_lawn, e_desert, f_forest, g_artificial_nature, h_plant). Paper's analysis: PRS score = mean of the four items per landscape; one-way ANOVA across the eight landscape types with post-hoc tests, and t-tests by gender, grade (freshman vs junior) and major (landscape vs non-landscape).\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very unlikely\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very likely\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"prs_coherence\",\n      \"title\": \"There is a clear order in the physical arrangement of places like these.\",\n      \"description\": \"Short PRS, one item per dimension (Coherence); 1 = very unlikely, 7 = very likely, as in the paper. The paper does not list its four items; this wording is from Hartig's PRS as listed in Frontiers in Public Health 10:801453 (being away, fascination, compatibility) and PRS-11 (coherence). One record per landscape photograph: key = image id as in the paper's Figure 1 (a_mountain, b_field, c_waterscape, d_lawn, e_desert, f_forest, g_artificial_nature, h_plant). Paper's analysis: PRS score = mean of the four items per landscape; one-way ANOVA across the eight landscape types with post-hoc tests, and t-tests by gender, grade (freshman vs junior) and major (landscape vs non-landscape).\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very unlikely\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very likely\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"prs_compatibility\",\n      \"title\": \"Being here suits my personality.\",\n      \"description\": \"Short PRS, one item per dimension (Compatibility); 1 = very unlikely, 7 = very likely, as in the paper. The paper does not list its four items; this wording is from Hartig's PRS as listed in Frontiers in Public Health 10:801453 (being away, fascination, compatibility) and PRS-11 (coherence). One record per landscape photograph: key = image id as in the paper's Figure 1 (a_mountain, b_field, c_waterscape, d_lawn, e_desert, f_forest, g_artificial_nature, h_plant). Paper's analysis: PRS score = mean of the four items per landscape; one-way ANOVA across the eight landscape types with post-hoc tests, and t-tests by gender, grade (freshman vs junior) and major (landscape vs non-landscape).\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very unlikely\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very likely\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"preference\",\n      \"title\": \"How much do you like this landscape?\",\n      \"description\": \"Visual preference on the paper's five-point scale, 0 = I don't like it at all … 4 = I like it a lot. One record per landscape photograph: key = image id as in the paper's Figure 1 (a_mountain, b_field, c_waterscape, d_lawn, e_desert, f_forest, g_artificial_nature, h_plant). Paper's analysis: PRS score = mean of the four items per landscape; one-way ANOVA across the eight landscape types with post-hoc tests, and t-tests by gender, grade (freshman vs junior) and major (landscape vs non-landscape).\",\n      \"rateMin\": 0,\n      \"rateMax\": 4,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"I don't like it at all\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"I like it a lot\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"landscape-original\">{\"source\": \"Zheng et al. (2025) PLOS ONE 20(8): e0330694, Table 2 (PRS, mean \\u00b1 SE, n = 49 viewing group) and section 3.3\", \"prs_mean_se\": {\"a_mountain\": [4.09, 0.2], \"b_field\": [4.26, 0.21], \"c_waterscape\": [4.95, 0.22], \"d_lawn\": [4.98, 0.19], \"e_desert\": [3.2, 0.21], \"f_forest\": [4.93, 0.2], \"g_artificial_nature\": [3.87, 0.23], \"h_plant\": [4.31, 0.23]}, \"preference_mean_se\": {\"c_waterscape\": [3.18, 0.15], \"e_desert\": [1.86, 0.16]}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f3f6f2;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f2a22;--muted:#5f6d63;--accent:#2f7d4f;--line:#dce5dd;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.45rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.view{background:#000;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:3/2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.view img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.thumb{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto}\n.timer{height:4px;background:var(--line);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:8px}.timer>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent);width:0}\n.big{font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin:18px 0;color:var(--ink)}\n.item{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.item:first-child{border-top:0}\n.item .t{margin-bottom:8px}\n.scale{display:grid;gap:6px}\n.scale button{appearance:none;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 0;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\n.scale button.on{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.item.miss .t{color:var(--warn)}\n.anch{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 6px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.f{margin-top:16px}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:110px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs: Zheng, Fang, Zhang, Liu &amp; Huang (2025), PLOS ONE 20(8): e0330694, Figure 1, CC BY 4.0.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var F=window.__VIEWMS, VIEW_MS=F||60000, REST_MS=F||60000, KEY='landscape8:state';\n  var ITEMS=['prs_being_away','prs_fascination','prs_coherence','prs_compatibility','preference'];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files=[], st=null, tm=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var k=a.length-1;k>0;k--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(k+1));var x=a[k];a[k]=a[j];a[j]=x;}return a;}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function id(n){return n.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'');}\n  function byId(i){for(var k=0;k<files.length;k++)if(id(files[k].name)===i)return files[k];return null;}\n  function newState(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(files.map(function(f){return id(f.name);})),k:0,phase:'view',r:0};}\n  function radio(n){var q=Q[n];return '<div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+(q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function countdown(ms,el,done){var end=Date.now()+ms;clearInterval(tm);function tick(){var s=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((end-Date.now())/1000));if(el)el.textContent=Math.floor(s/60)+':'+('0'+(s%60)).slice(-2);if(s<=0){clearInterval(tm);done();}}tick();tm=setInterval(tick,F?10:250);}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Eight landscapes</h1><p>You will first look at '+st.order.length+' landscape photographs, one minute each, with a one-minute rest after each photo. Please experience each picture in silence. Afterwards you rate every landscape on five short questions. Please use a large screen in a quiet place. About 20 minutes.</p>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q.age.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"number\" id=\"age\" min=\"16\" max=\"99\"></div>'+radio('gender')+radio('grade')+radio('major')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var age=Number(document.getElementById('age').value);if(!(age>=16&&age<=99))return err('Please enter your age.');\n      var g=function(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name='+n+']:checked');return x?x.value:null;};\n      var v={gender:g('gender'),grade:g('grade'),major:g('major')};for(var n in v)if(!v[n])return err('Please answer: '+Q[n].title);\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;\n      Promise.all([SPSite.answer('consent',true),SPSite.answer('age',age),SPSite.answer('gender',v.gender),SPSite.answer('grade',v.grade),SPSite.answer('major',v.major)]).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}st.step='view';st.k=0;st.phase='ready';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function ready(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>Viewing</h2><div class=\"card\"><p>Each photograph stays on screen for one minute, followed by a one-minute rest. Please look at it quietly and fully experience the landscape.</p><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Show the first photo</button></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){st.phase='view';save();route();};\n  }\n  function view(){\n    var f=byId(st.order[st.k]);if(!f){st.k++;save();return route();}\n    app.innerHTML='<p>Photo '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</p><div class=\"view\"><img alt=\"Landscape photograph\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><div class=\"timer\"><i id=\"tb\"></i></div>';\n    var tb=document.getElementById('tb');tb.style.transition='width '+(VIEW_MS/1000)+'s linear';requestAnimationFrame(function(){requestAnimationFrame(function(){tb.style.width='100%';});});\n    tm=setTimeout(function(){st.k++;if(st.k>=st.order.length){st.step='rate';st.r=0;}else st.phase='rest';save();route();},VIEW_MS);\n  }\n  function rest(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>Rest</h2><div class=\"card\"><p>Please rest for one minute before the next photo.</p><div class=\"big\" id=\"cd\"></div><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\" disabled>Next photo</button></div>';\n    var go=document.getElementById('go');go.onclick=function(){st.phase='view';save();route();};\n    countdown(REST_MS,document.getElementById('cd'),function(){go.disabled=false;});\n  }\n  function rate(){\n    if(st.r>=st.order.length)return finish();\n    var f=byId(st.order[st.r]);if(!f){st.r++;save();return rate();}\n    var vals={};\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>Landscape '+(st.r+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</h2><p>Think of the landscape in this photo.</p><div class=\"view thumb\"><img alt=\"Landscape photograph\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><div class=\"card\">'+\n      ITEMS.map(function(k){var q=Q[k];var lo=q.rateMin==null?1:q.rateMin,hi=q.rateMax||7,b='';for(var v=lo;v<=hi;v++)b+='<button type=\"button\" data-v=\"'+v+'\" aria-label=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</button>';\n        return '<div class=\"item\" data-k=\"'+k+'\"><div class=\"t\">'+esc(q.title)+'</div><div class=\"scale\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat('+(hi-lo+1)+',1fr)\">'+b+'</div><div class=\"anch\"><span>'+lo+' = '+esc(q.minRateDescription)+'</span><span>'+hi+' = '+esc(q.maxRateDescription)+'</span></div></div>';}).join('')+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:12px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Next</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    app.querySelectorAll('.item').forEach(function(it){it.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){vals[it.dataset.k]=Number(b.dataset.v);it.classList.remove('miss');it.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('on',x===b);});};});});\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var miss=ITEMS.filter(function(k){return vals[k]==null;});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(k){app.querySelector('.item[data-k=\"'+k+'\"]').classList.add('miss');});return err('Please answer every question ('+miss.length+' missing, marked).');}\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;var key=st.order[st.r];\n      Promise.all(ITEMS.map(function(k){return SPSite.answer(k,vals[k],{key:key,shown:[f.name]});})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}st.r++;save();rate();});\n    };\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){var m=r.missing||[];if(m.length&&m.every(function(x){return ITEMS.indexOf(x)>=0;})){st.step='rate';st.r=0;}else st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function route(){clearInterval(tm);clearTimeout(tm);if(st.step==='view'){if(st.phase==='ready')return ready();if(st.phase==='rest')return rest();return view();}if(st.step==='rate')return rate();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','age','gender','grade','major'].concat(ITEMS).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    files=(SPSite.getMedia('landscapes')||[]).filter(function(f){return /\\.(jpe?g|png|webp)$/i.test(f.name);});\n    if(!files.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Photos missing</h1><p>Upload the landscape photographs to the media folder \"landscapes\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    if(!st||!st.order||st.order.length!==files.length||st.order.some(function(i){return !byId(i);}))st=newState();\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};if(a.consent!==true)st.step='intro';\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
